WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:08,630
To the Lord of Sheng Zhijie

2
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:10,630
Please take care of Shengguang Village

3
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:13,630
Your devout followers will be able to stay away from the darkness

4
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:15,830
Sheng Jie cannot clear this road

5
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:18,230
His followers progressed so brutally

6
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:21,970
don't be afraid

7
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,260
Shengjie has brought us here

8
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:26,260
Shengjie has not abandoned you

9
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,620
It's the smell of an outsider

10
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:31,460
Sheng Jie sent someone to rescue him

11
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,460
Where is that vampire from the vampire family now?

12
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:37,090
Leave it to us

13
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,290
The devil is out there

14
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,890
The power of Shengjie who lucks in the church

15
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,490
Let him not dare to come close for the time being

16
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,290
Otherwise we would have died long ago

17
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:50,720
What nonsense is that?

18
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:53,720
In this case, let’s go, Uncle Zhao

19
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,120
You protect the villagers

20
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:56,320
no matter what happens

21
00:00:56,320 --> 00:01:14,150
Put your own safety first, don’t worry, little god

22
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:16,150
Also wearing a silver revolver

23
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:20,340
It's an adult

24
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:23,390
It's the adults who have come to save us personally.
